# 🚀 Vinea ERP - Comprehensive Project Requirements Document (PRD)

**Document Version:** 3.0  
**Date:** December 2024  
**Project Name:** Vinea ERP  
**Key Enhancement:** Multi-tenant Architecture

## Executive Summary

Vinea ERP is a modern, cloud-ready Enterprise Resource Planning system designed for small to medium-sized enterprises with robust multi-tenant capabilities. Built on a scalable architecture using FastAPI and Next.js, it provides comprehensive business management features including accounting, inventory management, order processing, and advanced reporting, all within a secure multi-company environment.

