## 1. Project Overview

### 1.1 Vision Statement
To develop a robust, scalable, and user-friendly web-based ERP system that empowers businesses with integrated management capabilities while supporting multiple companies within a single deployment.

### 1.2 Objectives
- **Multi-Tenant Support**: Complete data isolation between companies
- **Comprehensive Coverage**: Full suite of business management modules
- **Modern Architecture**: Cloud-native, API-first design
- **User Experience**: Intent-based navigation and intuitive interfaces
- **Scalability**: Support for growing businesses and user bases
- **Integration Ready**: APIs for third-party integrations

### 1.3 Target Audience
- Small to Medium Enterprises (SMEs)
- Multi-company organizations
- Accounting firms managing multiple clients
- Growing businesses requiring scalable solutions

