## 2. Multi-Tenant Architecture

### 2.1 Tenant Isolation Strategy
- **Database Level**: Row-level security with company_id foreign keys
- **Application Level**: Middleware-enforced tenant context
- **API Level**: Tenant-aware authentication and authorization
- **UI Level**: Company selector and context switching

### 2.2 Multi-Tenant Features
- **Company Management**
  - Multiple companies per deployment
  - Company-specific configurations
  - Inter-company transactions (Phase 13)
  - Consolidated reporting (Phase 13)

- **User Access**
  - Users assigned to specific companies
  - Superadmin access across companies
  - Company-specific role permissions
  - Cross-company user management

- **Data Isolation**
  - Automatic company_id filtering
  - Tenant-aware queries
  - Secure data boundaries
  - Audit trails per company

### 2.3 Tenant Onboarding
- Self-service company creation
- Template-based setup
- Default chart of accounts
- Industry-specific configurations

