- **CSRF Protection**: Token-based protection

### 9.2 Compliance Features
- **Audit Trails**: Complete transaction history
- **Data Retention**: Configurable retention policies
- **Privacy Controls**: GDPR compliance tools
- **Financial Compliance**: Support for various accounting standards
- **Report Generation**: Compliance report templates

### 9.3 Multi-Tenant Security
- **Data Isolation**: Strict tenant boundaries
- **Access Control**: Company-specific permissions
- **Audit Logging**: Per-tenant audit trails
- **Backup/Restore**: Tenant-specific operations
- **Compliance**: Per-tenant compliance settings

